msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"That hostess and Haruka-san are both wonderful girls,\r\n"
"but in the end, I know she's the one for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "You know you're in the way if you stand there, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Oh, sensei! You're here again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "...You again? Onto yet another girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"No... I just couldn't get the girl from the burger joint\r\n"
"out of my mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"The woman in Hatsumachi was really pretty, but she didn't\r\n"
"like younger guys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Haruka-san was totally my type, but she's your wife..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Uh, no, you've got that completely wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "In the end, the hamburger girl is the only one for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Even after all that, when I went to buy a burger, she still\r\n"
"said hi to me, and gave me this big, beautiful smile!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"That smile melted my heart. And when she handed me my\r\n"
"change, she held the coins almost like she wanted to hold\r\n"
"my hand instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"That's when I knew she was the one! Destiny must have drawn\r\n"
"us together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You're in for some disappointment in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"So I decided to ask her out again. But don't worry, sensei!\r\n"
"I've learned what to do from you. I'll ask her myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Good luck with that."
msgstr "Buona fortuna, allora."

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Well, here I go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "(I can't help but worry about him...)"
msgstr ""

